                <div class="instruction-box">
                    <p><span class="bullet">1</span><span><strong>Left column (6.1):</strong> these are the details on the valuation roll. You cannot change them.</span></p>
                    <p><span class="bullet">2</span><span><strong>Right column (6.2):</strong> fill in <strong>only</strong> the details you want the City to change. Leave the others blank.</span></p>
                    <p><span class="bullet">3</span><span>Fill in <strong>at least one</strong> detail in the right column, otherwise you cannot continue.</span></p>
